' A hand pump installed where it works, and what the spring makes of it.
'
' Run it with `give item_hand_pump`. Sana's spring yields 5 a turn, so
' v0.9.1's `water / 4` adds one and INFO's water line reads 6 instead of 5.
' Both `esc`s matter: the first leaves the room, the second the location,
' and INFO has to be opened from the map to be worked out again.
mapclick 150,318         ' set out for Sana
wait 40
wait 40
mapclick 150,318         ' into Sana
wait 10
mapclick 303,115         ' the well - the room flagged as the water source
wait 5
uiclick 168,248          ' put the pump down in it
wait 5
esc
wait 5
esc
wait 10
menu 300,300
menuline 0               ' INFO
mapclick 150,318
wait 3
snap pump_after
quit
